      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@value": "A circus show in residence for GOP – Variety Theater, located in Germany In our attic, we watch a year go by and discover with the artists of FLIP Fabrique how to dance in the rain. The romance of a snow squall becomes an intense experience that can brighten dark seasons and make them brighter. […]"
      }
