      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@value": "Free outdoor travelling circus show presented by the city of Québec Aug 5 – Sept 4 2022 The bell has rung. Recess can begin! Pupils tear off a piece of their school gym, fold it up and set off on an adventure through the city. Handball, badminton, volleyball and basketball lines tangle together like festive […]"
      }
